        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI can reproduce the issue with the non-artificial LSP progress (as the repro of spamming `vim.notify` is kind of not ideal indeed).\n\nI'll take a look, but I have a feeling that this is something better handled upstream in Neovim. Not showing any notifications while Operator-pending mode is active is not the best solution at first glance.",
